      "content": "it just feels so pointless to keep trying to \"fix\" it when there's nothing left to fix. if the person who was supposed to live this life is already gone, then staying here feels like just being a ghost in a body. it feels like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up and vanish. wouldn't it just be easier if it was all over?",
